#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "WCPOS Pro – Point of Sale for WooCommerce"
msgstr "WCPOS Pro – Afgreiðslukerfi fyrir WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://wcpos.com/pro"
msgstr "https://wcpos.com/pro"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"A complete Point of Sale solution for WooCommerce. Pro includes all features from the free plugin plus multi-store support, custom receipts, and more."
msgstr ""
"Heildarlausn fyrir afgreiðslukerfi í WooCommerce. Pro inniheldur alla eiginleika frá ókeypis viðbótinni auk stuðnings við margar verslanir, sérsniðnar kvittanir og fleira."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "kilbot"
msgstr "kilbot"

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "http://www.kilbot.com"
msgstr "http://www.kilbot.com"

msgid "Stores"
msgstr "Verslanir"

msgid "Cashiers"
msgstr "Gjaldkerar"

msgid "Gateways"
msgstr "Gateway"

msgid "WooCommerce POS Pro is now standalone."
msgstr "WooCommerce POS Pro er nú sjálfstætt."

msgid ""
"The Pro plugin includes all features from the free version. You can safely deactivate and delete this plugin."
msgstr ""
"Pro viðbótin inniheldur alla eiginleika frá ókeypis útgáfunni. Þú getur örugglega óvirkjað og eytt þessari viðbót."

msgid "Edit Store"
msgstr "Breyta verslun"

